---

This project began from Julian Ivanov's "jarvis-voice-assistant" template
(https://github.com/Julian-Ivanov/jarvis-voice-assistant) and was substantially
rewritten (E.V. identity, local Ollama + Whisper stack, cyber dashboard,
Turkish/English support, deterministic PC control and long-term memory).

Character inspiration: E.V. from "Spider-Man: Brand New Day". This is a fan
project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Marvel or Sony.
